      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks that's a start but i feel like i'm seeing a lot of stuff online saying these plans are actually just a way for the government to restrict where people can drive or even lock them into certain zones. people are calling it a loss of freedom. is there any truth to that or is it just people being paranoid?",
